  "justification": "Each AniDB episode holds two TVDB half-episodes: AniDB 1 \"The Roman Who Leapt Through Time / Swan Lake\" is TVDB season 1 episodes 1 and 2, AniDB 2 \"Shampoo Hat / The Melancholy of the Emperor\" episodes 3 and 4, AniDB 3 \"The Power of Baths First Part / Second Part\" episodes 5 and 6; by default 2 and 3 fell on Swan Lake and Shampoo Hat. Specials by title: S1 Yoyogi Animation Gakuin collaboration = season 0 episode 1 \"A visit to Yoyogi Animation Academy\" (2012-07-09), S5 \"Pietrada's Marriage\" = 6, S7 \"The Fascination of Pharos\" = 2 \"Alluring Pharos\", S8 \"The Three Office Lady Sisters' Thermae Murder Mystery\" = 4, S9 \"I Want to Feel Smooth\" = 5, S10 \"I Want to Slip Honestly\" = 3 \"I Just Want To Slip\". S2-S4 (Asahi Shimbun, LOFT and TOTO collaborations) and S6 \"Ancient Roman Goes to Space\" have no TVDB episode.",
